|---|---|---|---|
| `--color-sensor-bt` | `#22a85a` | `#4be08c` | Bean Temperature (녹색) |
| `--color-sensor-bt-target` | `rgba(40,180,130,0.65)` | `rgba(75,224,140,0.65)` | BT 목표 곡선 |
| `--color-sensor-et` | `#4a85c5` | `#beacf8` | Environmental Temp (청색) |
